(*` {CSY}Historie{ENU}History{}: *)
(*`
{CSY}
v1.0 20.06.2012 zis Prvnн verze knihovny, pouze иtenн stavu
v1.1 25.11.2012 zis Doplnмno ovlбdбnн ъstшedny
v1.2 04.12.2012 nem Poиet zуn zvмtЪen na 192
v1.3 08.01.2013 nem Ve zpracovбnн odpovмdi od ъstшedny doplnмna 
                    ochrana proti nulovйmu инslu zуny
v1.4 15.03.2013 nem Oprava posнlбnн arm pшнkazщ s heslem 
                    Doplnмno zpracovбnн 'Virtual PGM Events'
                    Doplnмno ovlбdбnн 'Virtual Inputs'
v1.5 20.03.2013 nem Zrychleno vysнlбnн arm pшнkazщ a
                    nastavovбnн virtбlnнch vstupщ 
v1.6 11.06.2013 byd OЪetшenн pшнjmu nulovйho инsla zуny
v1.7 14.10.2014 nem Opravena signalizace stavu podsystйmu
                    (T_PAR_DIG_EVO_PART_STATE.ready)
                    Uprava kontroly AP pro on-line zmeny 

{ENU}
v1.0 2012-06-20 zis First version of library
v1.1 2012-11-25 zis Control of Paradaxox was added
v1.2 2012-12-04 nem Number of zones increased to 192
v1.3 2013-01-08 nem Added protection of zero number of zone
                    in answer from Paradox
v1.4 2013-03-15 nem Fixed error for sending arm commands with user code
                    Processing of messages 'Virtual PGM Events' was added
                    Control of 'Virual Inputs' was added
v1.5 2013-03-20 nem Arm commands and setting of virtual inputs 
                    are sent with higher frequency
v1.6 2013-06-11 byd Handling of receiving zero zone number
v1.7 2014-10-14 nem Setting of state of partition was corrected  
                    (T_PAR_DIG_EVO_PART_STATE.ready)
                    Checking of AP adapted for on-line change
